⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Using wrong bounds

```java id="e1"
List<? extends String> list;
```

---

❌ Adding values to upper bounded collections

```java id="e2"
List<? extends Number> list;
list.add(10);
```

---

❌ Confusing `extends` and `super`

