📚 Key Takeaways

✔ `?` represents an unknown type
✔ Unbounded wildcards accept any type
✔ Upper bounded wildcards use `extends`
✔ Lower bounded wildcards use `super`
✔ Bounded types restrict generic parameters
✔ Generics improve type safety and reusability


